Subject: [PATCH 04/10] x86/ticketlock: collapse a layer of functions
Date: Wed, 14 Sep 2011 17:31:36 -0700
Message-Id: <19f816e61e8ca8a0589f0a255112dd72d7e17f9f.1315878463.git.jeremy.fitzhardinge@citrix.com>
